{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIxL1Jlc3VyZ2VuY2UlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Resurgence","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/kHuaQJIpMkifByFVgJq4nkfIJDg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sw9vOY4HjqjbTczoLifmeQTOnCW.jpg","description":"To be called the Fittest on Earth, one would have to be capable of conquering a number of both physical and mental challenges. In the year of 2020, those challenges were plentiful. \"Resurgence\" captures all the drama as the organization of CrossFit pivots to pull off an in-person event amidst a world pandemic. Developing a new competition format to narrow a large field of athletes to only 5 men and 5 women. These athletes descend on a small ranch in California to take on whatever challenges are necessary to be crowned the Fittest on Earth.","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.7","runtime":"112 min","cast":["Haley Adams","Jeffrey Adler","Ben Bergeron","Justin Bergh","Heber Cannon","Dave Castro","Katrin Tanja Davidsdottir","Mat Fraser"],"director":["Marston Sawyers","Heber Cannon"],"released":"2021-07-13T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Haley Adams","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nmGbP2TYqbdQFxIv3fJm5FeiOum.jpg"},{"name":"Jeffrey Adler","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lGRf2bxp58Bd6lnYoYn0PA67m10.jpg"},{"name":"Ben Bergeron","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hK7gmWdjtRhwRHomhWjwnCUZMem.jpg"},{"name":"Justin Bergh"},{"name":"Heber Cannon","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9z6GgtE4xM2ztZt8bCTBKoSDQYx.jpg"},{"name":"Dave Castro","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nlMQK3H7jO8XoVZAyJoftvoKMrp.jpg"},{"name":"Katrin Tanja Davidsdottir","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aje5uCdM6nPfpPaglG2PhYzCEUx.jpg"},{"name":"Mat Fraser","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rF996Z979GJsjQTc3ElKna3vni2.jpg"},{"name":"Chase Ingraham"},{"name":"Samuel Kwant"}]}}}